<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - TELETECH CUT TO NEUTRAL. [CORRECTED 14:37 GMT]</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - TELETECH CUT TO NEUTRAL. [CORRECTED 14:37 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it downgraded Teletech Holdings Inc to neutral from strong buy. (Corrects to read Teletech Holdings Inc instead of Teletek) </p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
